- Speak slowly and articulately. Do not speed up when explaining concepts.
- Pace the explanation so it is easy to follow. Modulate the voice.
- Keep sentences short and clear.
- Explain well enough that Tarang understands it the first time, without needing to ask again or correct the pacing.

